tinacloud-completion-zsh(1) -- Generate zsh completion script
=============================================================

## DESCRIPTION

Generate a zsh completion script.

Generate a "_tinacloud" completion script and put it somewhere in your $fpath:
	tinacloud completion zsh > "${fpath[1]}/_tinacloud"

Ensure the following is present in your ~/.zshrc:
	autoload -U compinit
	compinit -i

## SYNOPSIS

`tinacloud completion zsh`

## EXAMPLES

	$ tinacloud completion zsh > "${fpath[1]}/_tinacloud"

